    AvatarPos: 0
    AvatarType: 0
    Texts:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Three days and she never used it. I had assumed that was
        the answer.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: "3\u65E5\u306F\u4F7F\u7528\u3057\u306A\u3044\u3002 \u7B54\u3048\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3068\u4EEE\u5B9A\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
